-4-[6-(pyridin-4-yl)hexa-1,3,5-trien-1-yl]aniline in which the nitrogen of the pyridine moiety is substituted by a 3-(triethylammonio)propyl group and two bromide ions. It is used to selectively stain yeast vacuolar membranes with red fluorescence."],"label":"FM 4-64 dye","obo_id":"CHEBI:52078","type":"class","exact_synonyms":["4-{6-[4-(dibutylamino)phenyl]hexa-1,3,5-trien-1-yl}-1-[3-(triethylammonio)propyl]pyridinium dibromide"]},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_52270","ontology_name":"chebi","related_synonyms":["tetrakis(N,N,N-trimethylmethanaminium) 5-({[4-(13-{4-[({3-carboxylato-4-[(2,7-dichloro-6-oxido-3-oxo-3H-xanthen-9-yl)methyl]phenyl}carbonyl)amino]-2,5-bis(methyloxy)phenyl}-1,4,10-trioxa-7,13-diazacyclopentadecan-7-yl)-2-hydroxy-5-(methyloxy)phenyl]amino}carbonyl)-2-(2,7-dichloro-6-oxido-3-oxo-3H-xanthen-9-yl)benzoate"],"ontology_prefix":"CHEBI","short_form":"CHEBI_52270","description":["A quaternary ammonium salt that is the tetrakis(\u003cem\u003eN\u003c/em\u003e,\u003cem\u003eN\u003c/em\u003e,\u003cem\u003eN\u003c/em\u003e-trimethylmethammonium) salt of 5-({[4-(13-{4-[({3-carboxy-4-[(2,7-dichloro-6-hydroxy-3-oxo-3\u003cem\u003eH\u003c/em\u003e-xanthen-9-yl)methyl]phenyl}carbonyl)amino]-2,5-bis(methyloxy)phenyl}-1,4,10-trioxa-7,13-diazacyclopentadecan-7-yl)-2-hydroxy-5-(methyloxy)phenyl]amino}carbonyl)-2-(2,7-dichloro-6-hydroxy-3-oxo-3\u003cem\u003eH\u003c/em\u003e-xanthen-9-yl)benzoic acid."],"label":"sodium green","obo_id":"CHEBI:52270","type":"class","exact_synonyms":["tetrakis(N,N,N-trimethylmethanaminium) 5-({[4-(13-{4-[({3-carboxylato-4-[(2,7-dichloro-6-oxido-3-oxo-3H-xanthen-9-yl)methyl]phenyl}carbonyl)amino]-2,5-bis(methyloxy)phenyl}-1,4,10-trioxa-7,13-diazacyclopentadecan-7-yl)-2-hydroxy-5-(methyloxy)phenyl]amino}carbonyl)-2-(2,7-dichloro-6-oxido-3-oxo-3H-xanthen-9-yl)benzoate"]},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_53209","ontology_name":"chebi","related_synonyms":["N,N,N-tripropylpropan-1-aminium oxido(trioxo)ruthenium","TP